3Cs for cache misses:
-> Compulsory: cold fetch. will miss even with an infinite cache

-> Capacity:   simply not enough space to hold data. Will happen even
   	       if we made it fully associative

-> Conflict:   misses occuring due to different addresses fighting for the
   	       same set (aka associativity conflicts)


